@host = http://localhost:5100

### What the register holds
GET {{host}}/installations

### A notification to everyone
POST {{host}}/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "alert",
  "title": "Resultat klara",
  "body": "Ett meddelande fran sample-servern",
  "route": "log",
  "highPriority": true
}

### A notification five seconds from now, so the app can be put in the background first
POST {{host}}/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "alert",
  "title": "Nu syns jag",
  "body": "Appen hann i bakgrunden",
  "route": "log",
  "highPriority": true,
  "delaySeconds": 5
}

### A notification to one tag expression
POST {{host}}/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "alert",
  "targetKind": "tags",
  "target": "kind:news && !team:blue",
  "title": "Bara till nyhetsprenumeranter",
  "body": "team:blue ar undantagna"
}

### A silent message; nothing is shown, the handler runs
POST {{host}}/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "silent",
  "data": { "sync": "everything" }
}

### Rebuild the widgets
POST {{host}}/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "widget",
  "widgetKind": "sample"
}

### Update the Live Activity
POST {{host}}/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "liveactivity",
  "activityKind": "sample",
  "title": "Uppdaterad fran servern",
  "body": "Innehallet kommer utifran"
}

### AI: the exposed Assistant feature (demo provider), one answer
POST {{host}}/ai/features/Assistant
Content-Type: application/json
Spine-Installation: sample-phone

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "system", "contents": [{ "$type": "text", "text": "Dropped: the server owns the prompt." }] },
    { "role": "user", "contents": [{ "$type": "text", "text": "Vad kan du göra?" }] }
  ]
}

### AI: the same, streamed as server-sent events
POST {{host}}/ai/features/Assistant
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream
Spine-Installation: sample-phone

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "contents": [{ "$type": "text", "text": "Vad kan du göra?" }] }
  ]
}

### AI: a feature the server owns. Summary is the demo; Story (Anthropic) and Quick (OpenAI) need keys
POST {{host}}/sample/summary
Content-Type: application/json
Spine-Installation: sample-phone

{
  "facts": ["Startade 10:02", "Missade kontroll 4 med två minuter", "Femma i klassen"],
  "feature": "Summary"
}

### AI: one picture from the Picture feature (OpenAI)
POST {{host}}/sample/picture
Content-Type: application/json

{ "prompt": "En orienteringskontroll i en granskog, akvarell" }

### AI: a token for a realtime voice session (Voice, OpenAI). The app opens "url" with "Authorization: Bearer {token}"
POST {{host}}/ai/realtime/Voice
Spine-Installation: sample-phone

### AI: what was spent, by day, feature and model (localhost only)
GET {{host}}/ai/usage
